      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Just like we have class called collections , java also provide a class called\n\"Arrays\".\n\n2. It is an utility class available in package java.util.\n\n3. It has multiple static methods to perform various operation on Arrays.\n\n4. Some methods are sort(), equal(), copy(), toString()  etc.. .",
